        "original_id": "a0e11105-b16a-560c-b7e7-7779fc983007",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joel Embiid, Sam Hinkie\n- Organizations: Philadelphia 76ers\n- Events: 2014 NBA draft, 2016–17 Philadelphia 76ers season\n- Concepts: \"The Process\", \"trust the process\"\n\nFacts:\n- Joel Embiid was drafted 3rd in the 2014 NBA draft.\n- Joel Embiid played his first NBA season in the 2016–17 Philadelphia 76ers season after suffering multiple foot injuries.\n- Joel Embiid played 31 games in the 2016–17 Philadelphia 76ers season before being ruled out for the rest of the season.\n- Joel Embiid nicknamed himself \"The Process\" in response to Philadelphia 76ers fans urging the team to \"trust the process\" during the Sam Hinkie era.",
